///////////////////////////////////////////////////////

Shortest way to count distinct elements. Directly converts
array to HashSet via Arrays.asList() in one line, duplicates
are auto-rejected. Time complexity is O(n) and space
complexity is O(n).

///////////////////////////////////////////////////////
//              TEST CASES                           //
///////////////////////////////////////////////////////

arr = {1, 2, 1, 3, 2}   => 3   // mixed duplicates
arr = {1, 2, 3, 4, 5}   => 5   // all unique
arr = {1, 1, 1, 1, 1}   => 1   // all same
arr = {5}               => 1   // single element
arr = {-1, -2, -1, 3}   => 3   // negative numbers
arr = {0, 0, 1, 2, 0}   => 3   // zeros as duplicates

